            "text_color": "#333333",
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/red-palm-fruit.webp",
            "title": "Organic Red Palm Oil",
            "title_size": "medium",
            "text": "<p><em>Vitamin E and beta-carotene source.<\/em> Unrefined red palm oil contributes naturally occurring vitamin E and tocotrienols — antioxidants that nourish the skin barrier the cream is built to protect. The deep red-orange color comes from the carotenoids, not added pigment. RSPO-certified sourcing.<\/p>",
            "show_popup": false,
