            "enable_highlight": false,
            "highlight_style": "marker"
          }
        },
        "founder-body": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>During our family's healthy-ingredients journey, we kept finding body creams labeled \"natural\" that still relied on petrolatum, dimethicone, or undisclosed fragrance. We wanted a barrier cream we could use on our kids' driest patches without worrying about what we couldn't pronounce.<\/p><p>Every ingredient in this jar earns its place. We won't cut corners on sourcing for margin — that line doesn't move.<\/p><p>— Sean Fillmore<\/p>",
            "text_size": "typeset",
            "secondary_color": false,
            "enable_highlight": false,
